re the advice goes (the shared log). */\n87-  log?: Log;\n2: * @file The user gestures that let a page make sound (PLAN.md WP 9.3; doctrine: Common ground): a browser starts an\n6: * A gesture is a key (`keydown`, except Escape, which the HTML standard does not count), a click (`click`) or the end\n7: * of a touch, a pen or a mouse press (`pointerup`). A touch's `pointerdown` is not one: a touch that starts may turn\n18: * isGesture({ type: 'keydown', key: 'Escape', isTrusted: true }); // false\n19: * @see engine/audio/runtime/gesture.test.ts\n22:/** The events that may be gestures, as `addEventListener` names them. */\n23:export const GESTURE_EVENTS = Object.freeze(['keydown', 'click', 'pointerup'] as const);\n29:  /** `KeyboardEvent.key`, for `keydown`. */\n3: * sticks as codes (engine/input/codes.ts). Any slot works: the active pad stays while it is connected, a pad in\n4: * another slot takes over when it is used while the active one rests, and a pad that leaves (disconnected or\n5: * replaced) releases everything it held at once.\n15: * Carried from `my-3d2dge:engine/my-3d2dge.js:595-619` (`tick`: any slot, the radial deadzone, release on\n16: * disconnect) and `my-3d2dge:docs/CONTROLS-AUDIT.md` (slot 0 only, drift and stuck buttons were its bugs).\n37:/** Where pads come from: `navigator.getGamepads`, or a test's slots. */\nboxHall.ts\neffects.ts\nevents.ts\npage.ts\nx describe: ok: look: 14 fields, 144 entries\nLooks: a material style plus a filter chain (post-processing), and the sky that lights it, as whole looks or one-filter presets.\nfallback: look:clean\nids: look:16-bit, look:aa/smooth, look:air/clear-air, look:air/dusty-sunbeams, look:air/lamplight, look:air/light-haze, look:air/morning-mist, look:ai","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed","uuid":"1535bdc7-1963-4b4f-9437-52abf8c08c55","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:13:36.109Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"real\t0m20.209s user\t0m3.387s sys\t0m1.50