{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RrhoSq4fGR2nvjTUDM43Zm","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/gfx/stageProps.ts:12: * takes off (engine/gfx/storeyCut.ts), lights and all, and says when its key changed. `lights()` lists this frame's\nengine/gfx/stageProps.ts:81:  lights(): PropLight[];\nengine/gfx/stageProps.ts:173:    lights: () => meshes?.lights() ?? [],\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:11: *   telegraphs.ts) at floor height, `trail` a ribbon, `bolt` a projectile; `lights()` lists the frame's lights.\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:137:  lights(): FxLight[];\nengine/app/view.ts:329:      const [hour, lamps] = [daytimeOf(options.run().world), stage.props.lights()]; // WP 13.23\nengine/gfx/stageSky.ts:8: * lights flickering at the frame time and lighting the frame's lamps too (engine/app/view.ts: the props' lamps that\nengine/gfx/stageSky.ts:61:/** What a frame gives the stage's lights: the camera, the focus (m), the time (s), the hour and the frame's lamps. */\nengine/gfx/stageSky.ts:67:  lamps?: readonly PoolLamp[];\nengine/gfx/stageSky.ts:84:   * `hour` (null without a clock) shows the hour's sky; the frame's `lamps` light the pool beside the level's spots.\nengine/gfx/sky.ts:98:   * Follows the camera and the focus (m), flickering at `time` (s), the frame's `lamps` among the pool's sources\nengine/gfx/sky.ts:101:  update(view: { camera: Camera; focus: readonly number[]; time: number; lamps?: readonly PoolLamp[] }): PoolSlot[];\nengine/gfx/sky.ts:287:    update({ camera, focus, time, lamps }) {\nengine/gfx/sky.ts:293:      return pool.update(focus, time, lamps);\nengine/world/props/library.ts:60:    light: { tag: 'sconce', color: '#ffc8a0', intensity: 12, distance: 8, decay: 1, position: [0, 0.5, 0.225], flicker: true }, // pretti\nengine/world/props/library.ts:141:    light: { tag: 'lantern', color: '#ffd9a0', intensity: 3, distance: 6, decay: 1, position: [0, 0.13, 0], flicker: true }, // prettier\nengine/world/props/catalog.ts:77:    light: {\nengine/world/props/catalog.ts:86:    place: { light: 'torch' },\nengine/world/props/prop.ts:166:  light: {\nengine/world/props/prop.ts:188:  light: {\n16: * - **The lantern**: an iron lantern with glowing panes, a cap and a carrying ring, 2 kg, its light flickering inside\n17: *   (the tag `lantern`).\n18- * - **The chair**: a plank chair, its seat on two slab sides and a back, 6 kg: what a player picks up and throws\n19- *   (WP 13.16).\n20- *\n21- * Each with a body stands on spawn points of its name (`chest`, `table`, …: `levelProps`, engine/world/props/place.ts).\n22: * The hooks are the kind's: a hit knocks the dynamic ones (the chest, the table, the bench, the lantern, the chair) and\n23- * leaves the rest; using one does nothing: the sim gives doors their use (engine/sim/doors.ts, WP 13.16), and a player\n24- * carries the light ones (engine/sim/interact.ts).\n25- *\n26- * Invariants: plain data (the kind's fields only), ids `prop:<name>`; every part of a prop with a body stands on its\n27- * base or above it, its lowest point the base (`x qa geo` checks it); sizes in metres, masses through `density`.\n28- *\n29- * @example\n30- * LIBRARY_PROPS['prop:table'].body.size; // [1.6, 0.75, 0.9]\n31- * Object.keys(LIBRARY_PROPS).length; // 9\n32- * @see engine/world/props/library.test.ts\n33- */\n34-import type { PropDefinition } from './prop';\n35-\n36-/** A quarter turn (rad): a ring stood up to face +Z, a limb hung down. */\n--\n131:  'prop:lantern': {\n132:    description: 'An iron lantern, 0.4 m high to its ring: a base, glowing panes, a top and a cap. 2 kg; its light flickers inside.', // prettier-\ncatalog.ts\nfittings.ts\nlibrary.ts\nplace.ts\nprop.ts","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed","uuid":"0f4b6a51-0965-4ea3-8ecc-2b9260b0b1a2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:20:53.875Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"engine/gfx/stageProps.ts:12: * takes off (engine/gfx/storeyCut.ts), lights and all, a