ion, hit-stop and time scale. \n328:- **Lockstep driver:** §12.3.\n330:### 3.9 Save, title and restart\n873:**A round is one Vigil of the Hour matched to player count**, starting at level 12 with all skills, starte\n880:### 12.3 Host-stamped lockstep\n920:- **Clock:** `inspector.pause()` once `createEngine` resolves: the engine's loop still samples input and d\n921:- **Hidden tabs:** the timer keeps stepping (throttled, catching up in chunks). A host hidden for over 20 \ndevice the warm-up runs during the card, so the world should be ready by the countdown, but no real GPU was here to measure that.\n\n- **Solo and couch driver:** the engine's normal frame loop, with interpolation, hit-stop and time scale. Extra pads and the\n  hovered target reach the sim through `input.virtual.axis('game:pads', ...)` and `axis('game:target', id)`.\n- **Solo and couch driver:** the engine's normal frame loop, with interpolation, hit-stop and time scale. Extra pads and the\n  hovered target reach the sim through `input.virtual.axis('game:pads', ...)` and `axis('game:target', id)`.\n- **Lockstep driver:** §12.3.\n\n### 3.9 Save, title and restart\n\n- The title screen is HTML over the live world. At boot, the local hero stands in the **Vigil Chapel** class-select stage.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018241HsjzjSHDuLw6X98NaK","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
