{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjFVWLmAwWzsV2qeJmtH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RXCV4RqveRmzZPd3m4k1cp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b,count=1):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b) if count==0 else s.replace(a,b,count)\nrep(\"At boot, the local hero stands in the **Vigil Chapel** class-select stage.\",\"At boot, the local hero stands in the **Chapel of Ease**, the class-select stage.\")\nrep(\"| **Vigil Chapel** | 28 × 20 | candle-lit stone | n/a | none | class select stage |\",\"| **Chapel of Ease** | 28 × 20 | candle-lit stone | n/a | none | class select stage |\")\nrep(\"- **Solo and couch:** `engine.inspector.actions.run('cmd', { seat, cmd })`, a scene dev action. It works while paused and\\n  is recorded.\",\"- **Solo and couch:** `engine.inspector.actions.run('cmd', { seat, cmd })`, a scene dev action (`defineScene(id, { actions:\\n  { cmd(w, args) { … } } })`). It works while paused and is recorded.\")\nrep(\"assert `window.__hubCheck.pass` for: `players=1`, `players=2`, `players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`, the same with `&scenario=host-leave`, `players=2&scenario=server`.\",\"assert `window.__hubCheck.pass` for: `players=1`; `players=2`, `3` and `4`, each with `&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`; `players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave`; `players=2&scenario=server`. These are the hub's own test.\")\nrep(\"- **Settings:** volumes (Master, Music 10%, Effects, Voices, UI),\",\"- **Controls:** one big diagram for the device in use, with the rebinding screen one press away.\\n- **Settings:** volumes (Master, Music 10%, Effects, Voices, UI),\")\nrep(\"- **Local feel.** A client's input returns after a round trip. On press, immediately show a click marker, skill tile flash and a UI sound; no prediction in the sim.\",\"- **Local feel.** A client's input returns after a round trip. On press, immediately show a click marker, skill tile flash and a UI sound; no prediction in the sim. Clients can't run ahead of the host, so a client waiting for the host's first batch keeps its veil up.\")\nrep(\"**Pass all five `hub` scenarios\",\"**Pass every `hub` scenario\") if \"**Pass all five `hub` scenarios\" in s else None\nrep(\"Pass all five `hub` scenarios and open from `file://`\",\"Pass every `hub` scenario and open from `file://`\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 395,420p PLAN.md | cut -c1-170; grep -n \"Vigil Chapel\" PLAN.md | cut -c1-100","description":"Apply small plan corrections and spot-check the systems section"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":658961,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1074},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed","uuid":"b750f58d-ec6c-447e-9a1d-752fdbd3dc00","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:45:18.574Z","request_id":"req_011CgjFVW2AZjWP9sw1fCCXe","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01RXCV4RqveRmzZPd3m4k1cp":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211947__x8ab6bc/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b,count=1):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b) if count==0 else s.replace(a,b,count)\nrep(\"At boot, the local hero stands in the **Vigil Chapel** class-select stage.\",\"At boot, the local hero stands in the **Chapel of Ease**, the class-select stage.\")\nrep(\"| **Vigil Chapel** | 28 × 20 | candle-lit stone | n/a | none | class select stage |\",\"| **Chapel of Ease** | 28 × 20 | candle-lit stone | n/a | none | class select stage |\")\nrep(\"- **Solo and couch:** `engine.inspector.actions.run('cmd', { seat, cmd })`, a scene dev action. It works while paused and\\n  is recorded.\",\"- **Solo and couch:** `engine.inspector.actions.run('cmd', { seat, cmd })`, a scene dev action (`defineScene(id, { actions:\\n  { cmd(w, args) { … } } })`). It works while paused and is recorded.\")\nrep(\"assert `window.__hubCheck.pass` for: `players=1`, `players=2`, `players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`, the same with `&scenario=host-leave`, `players=2&scenario=server`.\",\"assert `window.__hubCheck.pass` for: `players=1`; `players=2`, `3` and `4`, each with `&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5`; `players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&scenario=host-leave`; `players=2&scenario=server`. These are the hub's own test.\")\nrep(\"- **Settings:** volumes (Master, Music 10%, Effects, Voices, UI),\",\"- **Controls:** one big diagram for the device in use, with the rebinding screen one press away.\\n- **Settings:** volumes (Master, Music 10%, Effects, Voices, UI),\")\nrep(\"- **Local feel.** A client's input returns after a round trip. On press, immediately show a click marker, skill tile flash and a UI sound; no prediction in the sim.\",\"- **Local feel.** A client's input returns after a round trip. On press, immediately show a click marker, skill tile flash and a UI sound; no prediction in the sim. Clients can't run ahead of the host, so a client waiting for the host's first batch keeps its veil up.\")\nrep(\"**Pass all five `hub` scenarios\",\"**Pass every `hub` scenario\") if \"**Pass all five `hub` scenarios\" in s else None\nrep(\"Pass all five `hub` scenarios and open from `file://`\",\"Pass every `hub` scenario and open from `file://`\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 395,420p PLAN.md | cut -c1-170; grep -n \"Vigil Chapel\" PLAN.md | cut -c1-100","description":"Apply small plan corrections and spot-check the systems section"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01RXCV4RqveRmzZPd3m4k1cp":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211947__x8ab6bc/work"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RXCV4RqveRmzZPd3m4k1cp","type":"tool_result","content":"couch; trail ribbon on sweeps; screen shake scaled by hit size. In lockstep there is no hit-stop: shake and flash only, since\nstopping time would stall every copy.\n\n**Kills.** Up to 6 simultaneous `handOff` ragdolls with a launch along the blow; other deaths play `deathBlown`,\n`deathCrush`, `deathSpin` and so on from `data/anim/actions`. Corpses fade after 6 to 10 s. Crowd rigs use `killAgent`.\n\n### 4.4 Skills\n\nA single runner reads a table row: `{ id, slot, resource cost or gain, cooldown steps, wind-up and recovery (scaled by attack\nspeed), move or action or clip to play, releases: [shape, percent, element, status, emitter, sfx], form overrides }`. Six\nslots, all class skills: **Primary, Secondary, Skill 1 to 4**. Unlocks by level: 1, 2, 4, 6, 9, 12. Inflections unlock at\nlevel 8 and level 14. Passive slots at 10 and 20. The player sets a skill's form and passives on the Skills screen, any\ntime out of combat. Hub rounds start at level 12 with everything unlocked.\n\n### 4.5 Monster AI\n\nA `brain` per row: `rush, ring, kite, charge, caster, ambush, guard, flee`. Flow fields to each hero (`grid.flowField(goal, {\nreach: 40 })`), `approachRing` for spacing, `takeToken` to cap melee attackers on a hero at 4 to 6, `canSee` and `sense` for\nwaking. Target the nearest hero, weighted by recent damage.\n\n### 4.6 Elites\n\n**Anointed:** 4 or 5 of a type, blue-tinted names, 1 affix, ×3 HP. **Exalted:** 1 leader (×5 HP, gold name, 2 or 3 affixes,\ngenerated name) with 3 to 6 minions. Name parts: first {Bishop, Sister, Deacon, Beadle, Verger, Abbess, Canon}, second {of\nCinders, the Unwashed, of the Ninth Pew, Who Wept, of Small Mercies, the Tithe-Taker, of the Long Hush}.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed","uuid":"a365098a-837a-4d61-81ab-a80e7dd6691b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:45:18.605Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"couch; trail ribbon on sweeps; screen shake scaled by hit size. In lockstep there is no hit-stop: shake and flash only, since\nstopping time would stall every copy.\n\n**Kills.** Up to 6 simultaneous `handOff` ragdolls with a launch along the blow; other deaths play `deathBlown`,\n`deathCrush`, `deathSpin` and so on from `data/anim/actions`. Corpses fade after 6 to 10 s. Crowd rigs use `killAgent`.\n\n### 4.4 Skills\n\nA single runner reads a table row: `{ id, slot, resource cost or gain, cooldown steps, wind-up and recovery (scaled by attack\nspeed), move or action or clip to play, releases: [shape, percent, element, status, emitter, sfx], form overrides }`. Six\nslots, all class skills: **Primary, Secondary, Skill 1 to 4**. Unlocks by level: 1, 2, 4, 6, 9, 12. Inflections unlock at\nlevel 8 and level 14. Passive slots at 10 and 20. The player sets a skill's form and passives on the Skills screen, any\ntime out of combat. Hub rounds start at level 12 with everything unlocked.\n\n### 4.5 Monster AI\n\nA `brain` per row: `rush, ring, kite, charge, caster, ambush, guard, flee`. Flow fields to each hero (`grid.flowField(goal, {\nreach: 40 })`), `approachRing` for spacing, `takeToken` to cap melee attackers on a hero at 4 to 6, `canSee` and `sense` for\nwaking. Target the nearest hero, weighted by recent damage.\n\n### 4.6 Elites\n\n**Anointed:** 4 or 5 of a type, blue-tinted names, 1 affix, ×3 HP. **Exalted:** 1 leader (×5 HP, gold name, 2 or 3 affixes,\ngenerated name) with 3 to 6 minions. Name parts: first {Bishop, Sister, Deacon, Beadle, Verger, Abbess, Canon}, second {of\nCinders, the Unwashed, of the Ninth Pew, Who Wept, of Small Mercies, the Tithe-Taker, of the Long Hush}.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RXCV4RqveRmzZPd3m4k1cp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
