{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjFYFyu8shs2EVD2nQtz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LghBrJnx5P2z8mCurDjjCx","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a\n    s=s.replace(a,b,1)\nrep(\"focusing one shows its three forms as three big cards with a short video-like live demo line. Passive slots.\",\"focusing one shows its three forms as three big cards, each saying in one line what that form does. Passive slots.\")\nrep(\"| Q9 | The Lamps Go Out | Evensong burns. Hold the square through 3 waves. Tobias explains at volume. |\",\"| Q9 | The Lamps Go Out | Evensong burns. Defend the town square through 3 waves. Tobias explains at volume. |\")\nrep(\"Keep the light about 0.8 m off the hero, since\\n  straight overhead his own shadow makes a black disc at his feet.\",\"Keep the light about 0.8 m off the hero, since\\n  straight overhead the hero's own shadow makes a black disc at their feet.\")\nrep(\"- Near-black outside the walls makes rooms feel like islands of light. Keep it.\",\"- Near-black outside the walls makes rooms feel like islands of light. Keep it. The hero's lantern (§3.5) does the rest.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \" his \\| him \\| he \\| she \\| her \" PLAN.md | cut -c1-150 | head -20; cat \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211947__x8ab6bc/tmp/claude-1000/-home-micha-dev-cc-matrix-runs-claude-opus-5-5-max-plan-v2--20261104-211947--x8ab6bc-work/3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed/tasks/b3n5jp7jq.output\" | tail -5 | cut -c1-1500","description":"Apply final wording fixes and check for the long round's result"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8427,"cache_read_input_tokens":667365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m