{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LghBrJnx5P2z8mCurDjjCx","type":"tool_result","content":"582:- **Old Gallows-Tom** (Road, level 5). A tall hanged man still wearing the noose. Noose lash pulls you in; he kicks up a ring of crows;\n583:  below half he drags his gibbet round the arena on a chain.\n584:- **Prior Ansgar the Unrung** (Undercroft, level 10). Three phases. *1:* censer sweeps and Knell rings. *2:* he strikes a hanging bell;\n585:  concentric rings you must cross through the gaps, and sarcophagi open. *3:* he tears off his robes, faster, chain lash, arena shrinks.\n590:  heart shows. Small hanging bells in the arena: strike one and it rings, stunning her and opening the heart for 6 s. This teaches the\n647:| Q8 | Still the Bell | Belfry. Hold Interact for 3 s to cut the rope. All music dies. Silence. Then her voice. |\n=== players=1\ndone true 12.8 s\nPASS\nlogs []\n=== long 2p with hashes\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: PLAN.md. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b0d0401-1a79-4c2f-8a33-ba9239fdbfed","uuid":"a5479593-4d80-428f-89c0-4f5a4a440b8f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:45:42.916Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"582:- **Old Gallows-Tom** (Road, level 5). A tall hanged man still wearing the noose. Noose lash pulls you in; he kicks up a ring of crows;\n583:  below half he drags his gibbet round the arena on a chain.\n584:- **Prior Ansgar the Unrung** (Undercroft, level 10). Three phases. *1:* censer sweeps and Knell rings. *2:* he strikes a hanging bell;\n585:  concentric rings you must cross through the gaps, and sarcophagi open. *3:* he tears off his robes, faster, chain lash, arena shrinks.\n590:  heart shows. Small hanging bells in the arena: strike one and it rings, stunning her and opening the heart for 6 s. This teaches the\n647:| Q8 | Still the Bell | Belfry. Hold Interact for 3 s to cut the rope. All music dies. Silence. Then her voice